{title: Let Me Tell You Who Jesus Is}
{key: F}

{comment: Chorus}
[F]Let me tell ya who [Bb]Jesus is
He's the rock of all [F]ages
He's the alpha and the [C]Omega
He's the Heavenly [F-C-F]father
[F]He's the beginning and the [Bb]end
Much more than [F]this my friend
He's the son of [C]man, he's coming back [F]again

{comment: Bridge}
I [F]know Jesus is the Father
I [F]know Jesus is the Son
I [F]know Jesus is the Holy Ghost
