{comment: Verse 1}
[F]Well the Jews were talking to Jesus and they said Just who are you
[F]You claim to be the Christ yet you're greater than Abraham too
[F]Jesus said everything that you say is true I'm greater than Abraham
[F]But before there was an Abraham I am the Great I am

{comment: Verse 2}
[F]Many People today they use his name
[F]But it's usually in Vain
[F]No matter how he's helped them time and time again
[F]But one of these days every tongue shall confess
[F]And every knee shall bow
[F]Let's not wait until that day let's Praise the Lord right now

{comment: Verse 3}
[F]Many People today love Jesus
[F]But they don't know who he is
[F]They put him 2nd place in the Godhead
[F]They've got some strange ideas
[F]But if Jesus Christ Created everything has all power I'm asking you
